<title>USA: AMEX to trade Trico Marine options from June 26.</title>
<headline>AMEX to trade Trico Marine options from June 26.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said Friday it will begin trading options on shares of Trico Marine Services Inc on June 26.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options will have opening strike prices of 20, 22-1/2 and 25, with position limits of 7,500 contracts. Initial expirations will be in July, August, November and February.</p>
<p>Highland Securities Co will be the specialist unit.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
